\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Returning\" title=\"Returning\">Returning</a>:</b> This missile will return to you.</span></span></li>\n<li>Special: Deals 10 to 60 <a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Negative Energy\">Negative Energy</a> Damage to nearby enemies, and possibly inflicting a <a href=\"/page/Negative_level\" title=\"Negative level\">negative level</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Gloaming_Philter.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Gloaming_Philter.png/420px-Gloaming_Philter.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"403\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Gloaming_Philter.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Doubly-enchanted glass containing pure water from a Shadowfell spring. Breaks on impact, dealing 10 to 60 Negative Energy Damage to nearby enemies, and possibly inflicting a negative level on them.<br /><br />Caution: Do Not Drink.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item currently cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a> and probably should be able to be.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816182118\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCo